+# todomvc-shakedown
+
+This project uses Shipshape for spec-driven development.
+
+See `RIGGING.md` for tooling values and methods.
+
+## Project
+
+A vanilla JavaScript TodoMVC implementation built from `assets/app-spec.md` and `assets/app-template.index.html`. No preprocessors. DOM-level scenarios use Cucumber and happy-dom.
+
+## Build
+
+No build step. Static files served from project root.
