+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: Watchbill shape conforms to spec
+    Given the project has a watchbill.json
+    When the watchbill is parsed
+    Then every watch contains only an ordered "scenarios" array
+    And each scenario reference uses the repo-root-relative form
+
+  @captain @conformance
+  Scenario: No standing perturbation token in implementation
+    Given the implementation directory is "js/"
+    When I search for "PERTURBATION" in files under "js/"
+    Then no standing perturbation token is found
